
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-event">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`touch(Detected: {DetectedEvent})`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`touch(integer NumberOfTouches)`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>This event is raised while a user is touching the object the script is attached to.<br>\t\t\tThe number of touching objects is passed to the script in the parameter.<br>\t\t\tInformation on those objects may be gathered via the llDetected* library functions.</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Detected / </span><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>NumberOfTouches</span></td>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Table with the detected events / </span><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span></span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-detected">Detected Event</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</DocsLayout>
      